The file layouts/Mewltiplex.json adapts Herdr's defaults/layouts/main.json.
The source src/oaklabs-brand/main.ts and its generated mods/oaklabs-brand/main.js adapt the header of Herdr's defaults/mods/workspace-chrome/main.js.
The source src/oaklabs-pane/main.ts and its generated mods/oaklabs-pane/main.js adapt Herdr's defaults/mods/pane/main.js.
The source src/oaklabs-companions/sidebar.ts and its generated mods/oaklabs-companions/sidebar.js adapt Herdr's defaults/mods/agents/main.js.
The source src/oaklabs-companions/toast.ts and its generated mods/oaklabs-companions/toast.js adapt Herdr's defaults/mods/toast/main.js.
The OakLabs layout changes the palette, pane frames and header styling.
